<title>USA: Investment Technology names president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Investment Technology names president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment Technology Group Inc said Wednesday that it has named Scott Mason, a long-time consultant to the firm, as president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The appointment is effective January 6, the company said.</p>
<p>The company's chairman, Raymond Killian has served also as president and chief executive since ITG was founded in 1986.</p>
<p>Killian will remain as chairman, the company said.</p>
